    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect packaging for tears, moisture, or impact marks; assess each box’s structural integrity, then record condition codes and assign priority levels for fragile or high‑value items.</p>
