    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Designate a clean, well‑lit staging zone near the entry, restrict unauthorized access, and label zones for electronics, furniture, and appliances to streamline subsequent uncrating steps.</p>
