</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">After verification, the team proceeds to test electrical and mechanical items, place furniture cleanly, and remove all packing debris swiftly.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This coordinated approach guarantees operational readiness, preserves aesthetics, and leaves the premises immaculate, reflecting Shree Ashirwad’s commitment to excellence and client satisfaction.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Each step follows a documented checklist, ensuring no detail is overlooked and enabling seamless handover to the client.</span></li></ul>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Functional Testing Procedure:</strong> Power‑on each electronic device, verify voltage, run diagnostic cycles, and confirm mechanical movements; document results on the testing sheet and report any anomalies before placement.</li>
  <li><strong>Sanitized Placement Guidelines:</strong> Position furniture on pre‑cleaned floor mats, maintain a minimum 5 cm clearance from walls, align legs with level markers, and use protective pads to avoid scratches.</li>
  <li><strong>Debris Extraction Protocol:</strong> Collect all boxes, foam, and wrappers; sort recyclable materials, load debris into sealed bins, and conduct a final sweep with a HEPA‑filtered vacuum to ensure dust‑free environment.</li>
  <li><strong>Final Walkthrough Confirmation:</strong> Perform a joint walkthrough with the client, verify that all items are functional and correctly positioned, and obtain a signed completion form confirming satisfaction and clean premises.</li>
</ul></div>
